[I] IBus predictive/completion input method engine

[T] ibus-typing-booster is a completion input method for IBus that speeds up
[T] typing by predicting likely words and phrases as the user types, using the
[T] m17n input methods to support many languages.

[U] https://github.com/mike-fabian/ibus-typing-booster

